# REGIONAL REGULATION OF SOUTH TANGERANG CITY

NUMBER 3 OF 2012

CONCERNING

PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE

BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

THE MAYOR OF SOUTH TANGERANG,

Considering:




a. that women and children biologically and philosophically constitute vulnerable groups and are susceptible to becoming victims of violence, both violence occurring within the household and that committed outside the household;
b. that violence against women and children constitutes a violation of human rights and a crime against human dignity as well as a form of discrimination that must be eliminated;
c. that protection of women and children victims of violence is one aspect of the duties and responsibilities of regional government in providing protection and services to the community;
d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letters a, b, and c, it is deemed necessary to establish the Protection of Women and Children Victims of Violence by Regional Regulation of South Tangerang City;

In View of:




1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 1 of 1974 concerning Marriage (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1974 Number 1, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3019);
3. Law Number 4 of 1979 concerning Child Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1979 Number 32, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3143);
4. Law Number 7 of 1984 concerning the Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (Convention Of Elimination Of All Forms Of Discriminations Againts Women) (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1984 Number 29, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3277);
5. Law Number 3 of 1997 concerning Juvenile Court (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1997 Number 3, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3668);
6. Law Number 5 of 1998 Concerning Ratification of the Convention Against Torture And Other Cruel, Inhuman Or Degrading Treatment Or Punishment (Convention Against Torture And Other Cruel, In Human Or Degrading Treatment Or Punishment) (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1998 Number 164, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3783);
7. Law Number 39 of 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);
8. Law Number 23 of 2000 concerning the Establishment of Banten Province (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2000 Number 182, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4010);
9. Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2002 Number 109, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4235);
10. Law Number 13 of 2003 concerning Manpower (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2003 Number 39, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4279);
11. Law Number 20 of 2003 concerning the National Education System (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2003 Number 78, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4301);
12. Law Number 23 of 2004 concerning the Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);
13. Law Number 32 of 2004 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2004 Number 125, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4437), as amended by Law Number 12 of 2008 concerning the Second Amendment to Law Number 32 of 2004 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2008 Number 59, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4844);
14. Law Number 23 of 2006 concerning Population Administration (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2006 Number 124, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4674);
15. Law Number 21 of 2007 concerning the Eradication of the Criminal Act of Trafficking in Persons (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2007 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4720);
16. Law Number 44 of 2008 concerning Pornography (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2008 Number 181, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4928);
17. Law Number 51 of 2008 concerning the Establishment of South Tangerang City in Banten Province (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2008 Number 188, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4935);
18. Law Number 14 of 2009 concerning Ratification of the Protocol To Prevent, Suppress And Punish Trafficking In Persons Especially Women And Children Supplementing The United Nations Convention Against Transnational Organized Crime (Protocol to Prevent, Suppress and Punish Trafficking in Persons, Especially Women and Children, Supplementing the United Nations Convention against Transnational Organized Crime (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2009 Number 53, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4990);
19. Law Number 35 of 2009 concerning Narcotics (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2009 Number 143, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5062);
20. Law Number 36 of 2009 concerning Health (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2009 Number 144, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5063);
21. Law Number 12 of 2011 concerning the Formulation of Legislation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2011 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5234);
22. Government Regulation Number 9 of 1975 concerning the Implementation of Law Number 1 of 1974 Concerning Marriage (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1975 Number 12, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3050);
23. Government Regulation Number 4 of 2006 concerning the Implementation and Cooperation for the Recovery of Victims of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2006 Number 15, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4604);
24. Government Regulation Number 38 of 2007 concerning the Division of Governmental Affairs Between the Provincial Regional Government and the Regency/City Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2007 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4737);
25. Presidential Decree of the Republic of Indonesia Number 182 of 1998 concerning the National Commission on Violence Against Women;
26. Presidential Decree of the Republic of Indonesia Number 12 of 2001 concerning the National Action Committee for the Elimination of the Worst Forms of Child Labor;
27. Presidential Decree of the Republic of Indonesia Number 87 of 2002 concerning the National Action Plan for the Elimination of Commercial Sexual Exploitation of Children;
28. Presidential Decree of the Republic of Indonesia Number 88 of 2002 Concerning the National Action Plan for the Elimination of Trafficking in Women and Children;
29. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment of the Republic of Indonesia Number 02 of 2009 Concerning the Child-Friendly Regency/City Policy;
30. Decree of the Minister of Home Affairs and Regional Autonomy Number 5 of 2001 concerning the Prevention of Child Labor;
31. Regional Regulation of Banten Province Number 10 of 2005 concerning Gender Mainstreaming in Regional Development (Regional Gazette of Banten Province of 2005 Number 45 Series E);
32. Regional Regulation of South Tangerang City Number 6 of 2010 concerning the Organization of Regional Apparatus of South Tangerang City (Regional Gazette of South Tangerang City of 2010 Number 6, Supplement to the Regional Gazette of South Tangerang City Number 0610);
33. Regional Regulation of South Tangerang City Number 8 of 2011 concerning Regional Governmental Affairs of South Tangerang City (Regional Gazette of South Tangerang City of 2011 Number 8, Supplement to the Regional Gazette of South Tangerang City Number 0811);

With Mutual Approval

REGIONAL HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES

OF SOUTH TANGERANG CITY

And

THE MAYOR OF SOUTH TANGERANG

DECIDES:

To Establish:

REGIONAL REGULATION OF SOUTH TANGERANG CITY CONCERNING PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE.
